  <section id="crew" aria-label="Features">
    <div class="sect-head" data-idx="01">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">meet the crew</p>
      <h2 class="kin"><span class="kw"><span class="kwi" style="--wi:0">One</span></span> <span class="kw"><span class="kwi" style="--wi:1">app.</span></span> <span class="kw"><span class="kwi" style="--wi:2">Eight</span></span> <span class="kw"><span class="kwi" style="--wi:3">crew</span></span> <span class="kw"><span class="kwi" style="--wi:4">members.</span></span></h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="--rd:0.25s">These aren't plugins bolted on later — they're what PaneCrew is. Every card below is one facet of the same window.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="crew-row">
        <article class="card reveal" style="--rd:0s">
          <div class="card-vis">
            <div class="minigrid" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="mp amb"><b>orbit-api — claude</b><span class="g">✓</span> tests green<br><span class="w">›</span> <span class="cursor"></span></div><!-- brandlint-ok: functional demo pane, real supported tool -->
              <div class="mp"><b>dashboard — codex</b><span class="y">⚠</span> 2 type errors<br>fixing imports…</div><!-- brandlint-ok: functional demo pane, real supported tool -->
              <div class="mp"><b>cli-tools — gemini</b><span class="b">ℹ</span> reviewing 6 files</div><!-- brandlint-ok: functional demo pane, real supported tool -->
              <div class="mp"><b>panecrew — zsh</b>$ pnpm tauri dev<br><span class="g">✓</span> ready</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="sticker">Grid</h3>
            <div class="pills">
              <span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><use href="#mkPanes"/></svg>2×2</span>
              <span class="badge">real PTY</span>
            </div>
            <p>Up to four real, PTY-backed terminals side by side across different projects — all visible at once. A grid, not a tab switcher.</p>
            <a class="more" href="/guides/multiple-cli-agent-sessions/">Running multiple agent sessions at once →</a>
            <a class="more" href="/guides/how-many-claude-code-sessions/" style="display:block; margin-top:4px;">How many sessions should you run? →</a><!-- brandlint-ok: functional cross-link, target guide's own title -->
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal" style="--rd:0.1s">
          <div class="card-vis">
            <div class="mock" data-title="explorer" aria-hidden="true">
              <div><span class="c">▾ dashboard</span> <span style="opacity:.5">← focus moved</span></div>
              <div><span class="tc">├─ </span>▾ src/charts</div>
              <div><span class="tc">│  └─ </span><span class="w" style="background:rgba(90,207,211,.16); padding:0 4px;">usage.tsx</span></div>
              <div><span class="tc">└─ </span>vite.config.ts</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="sticker">Sidekick</h3>
            <div class="pills">
              <span class="badge cy"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><use href="#mkPanes"/></svg>follows focus</span>
            </div>
            <p>One file explorer for the whole grid. Click a pane — the tree is already showing that project. View, edit, move on.</p>
            <a class="more" href="/guides/prevent-agents-editing-same-files/">Running several agents on one repo? →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="crew-row rev">
        <article class="card reveal" style="--rd:0s">
          <div class="card-vis">
            <div class="tabsvis" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tabrow">
                <span class="tab">&gt;_ terminal</span>
                <span class="tab on">router.ts</span>
