                ];
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="sticker">Flip</h3>
            <div class="pills">
              <span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><use href="#mkPanes"/></svg>terminal ⇄ file</span>
            </div>
            <p>Mini-tabs flip a pane between its terminal and the file you just opened — no window juggling, no second editor.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal" style="--rd:0.1s">
          <div class="card-vis">
